      "releaseNotes": "NEW: NATIVE iPhone Duo SUPPORT\n\n• Fold iPhone Duo into a tabletop position to enter Desk view automatically.\n• Watch the aquarium and clock above the hinge, with feeding, lighting and aquarium controls below.\n• Open flat to return to the full tank after entering Desk view by folding.\n• Layouts adapt to the inner and outer displays and keep controls clear of the fold.\n\nYour saved fish, scenery and settings stay with you.",
